rty-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74fe2bcb840f383c\" href=\"?note=74fe2bcb840f383c\" title=\"67-df-independence-type\">67-df-independence-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d1cb776524abeca\" href=\"?note=0d1cb776524abeca\" title=\"67-thm-disjoint-numerations\">67-thm-disjoint-numerations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 4; Corollary 1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"45–46"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"56–57"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 为一致原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"74fe2bcb840f383c\" href=\"?note=74fe2bcb840f383c\" title=\"67-df-independence-type\">67-df-independence-type</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}(F)\\)</span>；其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Realizes}_T,\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Realizes}_T,\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T\\)</span> 使用同一命题树与算术句法代入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 是本册强算术句法编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_1\\)</span> 是一元原始递归函数类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1,\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(B_1,\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]=\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]=\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为本册归纳公理集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的句法编号精确取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_L\">\\(g=c_L\\)</span>（算术语言时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L_A\">\\(L=L_A\\)</span>）；数词代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a> 的对应程序，图公式使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a> 的公式编号；实现序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 的值为句子，故代码序列使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\circ\\Phi\">\\(g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\circ\\Phi\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\Phi\\in(B_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A})^{\\mathbb N}\\quad\n(g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\circ\\Phi)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\land\\mathrm{Realizes}_T(\\Phi,F),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\Phi\\in(B_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A})^{\\mathbb N}\\quad\n(g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\circ\\Phi)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\land\\mathrm{Realizes}_T(\\Phi,F),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 3.4 与 Corollary 3.1，pp.45–46（PDF 56–57）。第一项是原始递归的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1\">\\(B_1\\)</span> 句子序列，不擅自加强成一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 公式；后一项需含 PA，由原始递归序列的统一表示得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Delta_2\\)</span> 公式。原书未标上标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Delta_2\\)</span> 在此精确记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，不把 PA 等价正规化擅自改弱成仅在 T 中等价。</p>\n<p>源证明沿有限0/1赋值树递归构造序列，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 加相应命题文字合取一致当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 加对应算术句子合取一致。各相容分支以 Theorem 3.2 的两个不交 r.e. 集同时 numeration 决定下一个句子；将有限分支结果合并保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1\">\\(B_1\\)</span> 和原始递归性。已核对陈述与归纳不变量，完整统一表示及算术化基础事实仍未独立形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-independence-type","status":"resolved","id":"74fe2bcb840f383c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-independence-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-disjoint-numerations","status":"resolved","id":"0d1cb77652